#Mission Info

$Version: 0.10
$Name:  XSTR("Dead Reckoning", -1)
$Author: Claude (extra missions for the Diaspora port)
$Created: 11/02/26 at 12:00:00
$Modified: 11/02/26 at 12:00:00
$Notes:
Generated by tools/make_extra_missions.py (non-commercial, CC BY-NC-SA with the Diaspora content).
$End Notes:

$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("[[Duration: ~13 min | Difficulty: Medium]] A Colonial supply convoy was ambushed and scattered. Its cargo pods are drifting near the Anchises relay, and one of them carries the fleet's last stock of antibiotics. Red flight has to scan the pods and find it before the Cylons come back for the rest.", -1)
$end_multi_text

